The one star shape of the theme (the 'd' of its path, in the 11 x 11 box of viewBox "0.996 0.786 11.008 11.008"): a regular five-point star with straight sides and sharp (not rounded) tips. The outline that goes with it must use stroke-linejoin="miter", otherwise the stroke rounds the tips again.
Every rating star - the rating badge, the reviews, the review cards, the testimonials and the review form - reads it from here (snippets/icon.liquid
and sections/reviews.liquid), so changing the shape means changing this one line.
{%- endcomment -%}
